{"toolCallId":"call_cefef3bedd3b4edda4751e12e98efe45","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"64:| `SPEC_DOC_SUFFICIENCY` | ERROR  | spec docs, goal.md | Anchor sufficiency; for `goal.md` also the durable budget (one limit: fail past 4000) and binding-row existence |\n767:**Rule:** `SPEC_DOC_SUFFICIENCY`, diagnostics `SPECDOC_SUFFICIENCY_005` (budget) and `SPECDOC_SUFFICIENCY_006` (binding)  \n792:SPECDOC_SUFFICIENCY_005: goal.md: durable slice is 4120 characters (> 4000). Cut it in the order section 3 of sk-create-goal's references/budget-and-handoff.md gives, and never drop a criterion.\n800:SPECDOC_SUFFICIENCY_006: goal.md: binding row names '003-runtime/goal.md' which does not exist inside the packet. Author the child goal and its row with /create:goal <parent> phase-add, or child when the folder already exists.\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w27ef8e22cd/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"136ff3","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
